      "writtenOn": "2022-04-21T10:19:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t found possibility to make property required if some other property is present. Only option for that would be failure at compile time e.g. in `USB_MUX_CONFIG_TCPCI_TCPM` macro.\n\nWhat do you think about adding `port` and `i2c-addr-flags` properties as not required and in `USB_MUX_CONFIG_TCPCI_TCPM` setting `USB_MUX_FLAG_NOT_TCPC` if these properties are present?",
      "parentUuid": "848a78c7_b79a17e2",
